  "wrap": "Reviewed the September metformin cost difference: the August Oak Street claim used preferred retail cost-share ($8), while the September Lakeview claim used standard retail cost-share ($27) for the same 30-day metformin 500 mg supply. Confirmed the current Lakeview Pharmacy refill status is ready for pickup; this is not pickup confirmation. Discussed the eligible 90-day option for future fills. Submitted enrollment in the CenterWell pharmacy service for future metformin fills only; atorvastatin remains at retail, and today’s Lakeview refill is unchanged. A coverage case for Jardiance 10 mg tablets is pending review.\n\nConnection result: DEMO-TRANSFER001 — receiving_specialist_connected. DEMO-CVR001 remains pending_review. Connection is not a coverage determination.\n\nDEMO-ENR001 · metformin · ready · DEMO-CVR001",
  "handoff": "Coverage Review handoff: Member Harry Whitfield (member ID DEMO-M001), case DEMO-CVR001. Requested medication: Jardiance 10 mg tablets; coverage status: pending_review. Member asked to enroll in CenterWell pharmacy service for future metformin fills; atorvastatin remains at retail. Checked active MAPD eligibility, coverage case status, enrollment submission, and retail refill status. Enrollment was submitted and returned scope was metformin (result ID DEMO-ENR001). Today's refill is ready for pickup at Lakeview Pharmacy; this is not an order, collection, or pickup confirmation. Connection has not occurred.",
